    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Dream Observatory</i>, you are the Dream Weaver\u2014guardian of dreams and curator of the oniric. Each night, you\u2019ll craft and deliver\u00a0unique dreamers, who are far from ordinary: a vampire burdened by immortality, a tiefling seeking peace, an angel who fell from grace and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/8699d07398399c3a053f5ae2638985f0.avif?t=1750674032\" width=524 height=138 /></span>Use your\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">logic</span>\u00a0emotions and intuition to mix and match Concepts and Dream Cards to guide them through the dream they need most. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/e17365fc2314ffd8c7db1a4c1c8b2f69.avif?t=1750674032\" width=524 height=138 /></span>Getting to know each dreamer in depth is key to deciding which dream is best for them. Analyze their inner world, desires and make your choice! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also be able to impact their lives with the power of dreams, if you wish. But beware! If you misread their emotions or choose poorly, you risk insomnia... and consequences that may ripple beyond a single night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/3a4e8cda4306956fd780f670ed791731.avif?t=1750674032\" width=524 height=138 /></span>When day breaks, explore the Observatory: gather resources, upgrade your tools, and piece together the secrets hidden within dreams. Get closer to the truth behind the Observatory\u2014and <strong>your own role in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/a4143c6b18e996387aa3dd07fb761a02.avif?t=1750674032\" width=551 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a blend of cozy gameplay and narrative depth, <i>The Dream Observatory</i> invites you to shape destinies through dreams, one soul at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/54671a91213ac059e5615f796ff92a5c.avif?t=1750674032\" width=551 height=95 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 base concepts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ dream cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of possible dream combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven progression with impactful choices and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your dream archive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an impossible observatory filled with secrets and strange machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy blend of <span class=\"bb_strike\">logic</span>\u00a0emotion, and storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamlike art style and a soothing, immersive soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Dream Observatory</i>, you are the Dream Weaver\u2014guardian of dreams and curator of the oniric. Each night, you\u2019ll craft and deliver\u00a0unique dreamers, who are far from ordinary: a vampire burdened by immortality, a tiefling seeking peace, an angel who fell from grace and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/8699d07398399c3a053f5ae2638985f0.avif?t=1750674032\" width=524 height=138 /></span>Use your\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">logic</span>\u00a0emotions and intuition to mix and match Concepts and Dream Cards to guide them through the dream they need most. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/e17365fc2314ffd8c7db1a4c1c8b2f69.avif?t=1750674032\" width=524 height=138 /></span>Getting to know each dreamer in depth is key to deciding which dream is best for them. Analyze their inner world, desires and make your choice! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also be able to impact their lives with the power of dreams, if you wish. But beware! If you misread their emotions or choose poorly, you risk insomnia... and consequences that may ripple beyond a single night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/3a4e8cda4306956fd780f670ed791731.avif?t=1750674032\" width=524 height=138 /></span>When day breaks, explore the Observatory: gather resources, upgrade your tools, and piece together the secrets hidden within dreams. Get closer to the truth behind the Observatory\u2014and <strong>your own role in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/a4143c6b18e996387aa3dd07fb761a02.avif?t=1750674032\" width=551 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a blend of cozy gameplay and narrative depth, <i>The Dream Observatory</i> invites you to shape destinies through dreams, one soul at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068640/extras/54671a91213ac059e5615f796ff92a5c.avif?t=1750674032\" width=551 height=95 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 base concepts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ dream cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of possible dream combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven progression with impactful choices and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your dream archive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an impossible observatory filled with secrets and strange machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy blend of <span class=\"bb_strike\">logic</span>\u00a0emotion, and storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamlike art style and a soothing, immersive soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become the Dream Weaver in The Dream Observatory, a cozy single-player card management game. Craft dreams for modern fantasy-inspired characters\u2014vampires, elves, tieflings and more\u2014by combining cards that reflect their desires. Explore the Observatory by day and uncover its secrets.",
